Error [E0003]: A tuple needs at least two named members
  --> tests/ui/tuple_single_field.jet:2:10
    |
  2 |     p :: (x: 1)
    |          ^^^^^^
 Why: A single `(name: value)` would be ambiguous with grouping — use a one-field `struct` instead
 Fix: Add another member: `(x: 1, y: 2)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
